                    "description": "Get ready to dance, sing, and laugh with Michael &amp; the Rockness Monsters! This YOTO music card is packed with upbeat, high-energy songs filled with silly lyrics, catchy melodies, and lively instruments like drums, guitars, saxophone, and trombone. From wacky adventures to playful storytelling, each track brings joy and excitement to kids of all ages.\n\nWhether you’re grooving to funky beats or belting out fun choruses, this greatest hits collection will have the whole family moving and singing along.\n\nPerfect for playtime, car rides, or dance parties—let the Rockness Monsters bring the fun to you!",
